### Calculating the Forward-Backward Correlation Strength

The forward-backward (FB) correlation strength \(b\) is calculated for all charged particles within the STAR TPC acceptance of \(|\eta|<1\) and with transverse momentum \(p_{T}>0.15\) GeV/c. The pseudorapidity range is subdivided into forward and backward

